[00:00.00]
[00:28.03]Voices from the other day make my heart feel constrained now.
[00:35.11]It was like that right? It was like this right?
[00:39.48]Like a self-interpreting receiver.
[00:42.72]If I don’t change, they say they’re bored of me;
[00:44.66]if I do change, they say I’ve changed.
[00:46.60]What the hell is that?
[00:48.37]What even is that?
[00:49.73]The spear and shield don’t seem to ever disappear.
[00:55.71]
[00:58.17]My defective eye shutter makes happiness out-of-focus,
[01:04.30]and the painful things delicately come out with a high-resolution lens.

[01:12.23]I’ve done my best,
[01:14.52]not particularly for any of you.
[01:17.61]Hey, this is how it is, huh?
[01:19.31]I can’t afford to live doing things that aren’t in my nature.

[01:24.94]A life that’s high,
[01:26.70]a life that’s in the forefront,
[01:28.40]life that’s wise, I so badly want to live a life like that,
[01:33.19]where the present world, with no foundation or proof, is just right.
[01:39.26]Life is rough,
[01:40.95]life is tough,
[01:42.80]it would be nice if life was as simple as a video game
[01:48.04]where I could select my future by gambling with the A・B buttons.

[01:55.58]I bet a hero’s private life is pretty boring.
[02:01.76]relatively negative, just like a normal person's
[02:07.41]
[02:10.20]I can’t afford to be deceived by the voices of others.

[02:15.59]More undisturbed,
[02:17.27]more unstable,
[02:19.09]cause according to the manual, it’s definitely too beautiful already.
[02:23.37]Pollute it, break it-
[02:25.56]cast aside the boring, fixed stereotypes.
[02:29.84]I really don’t give a shit anymore.
[02:32.23]With suffocated voices,
[02:34.63]we thoughtlessly nod to things we don’t want to do.
[02:41.18]Stop that,
[02:42.94]look up, lift your head

[02:46.68]I’ve grown so tired.
[02:49.76]I don’t want to be just an empty shell produced by our egos.
[03:00.86]There’s still time, come on,
[03:03.97]alone with regret right before my eyes,
[03:08.42]the crumpled lines on the EKG
[03:12.48]remind me of just one thing

[03:16.83]sorrow, sorrow, sorrow, sorrow, sorrow, sorrow, Sorrow!!!
[03:29.88]
[03:51.63]A life that’s high,
[03:53.42]a life that’s in the forefront,
[03:55.21]a life that’s wise, I so badly want to change to a life like that,
[03:59.86]where the present world, with no foundation or proof, is suited for me..
[04:05.88]Life is rough,
[04:07.59]life is tough,
[04:09.36]really, I want to live as plain and simple as a video game
[04:14.69]where I could change my future with the A・B buttons.
